@page
@model BSE.Host.Pages.AccessibilityModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Accessibility statement";
}

<h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Accessibility statement for the BSE Database System</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">This statement applies to the BSE Database System, operated by the Animal and Plant Health Agency (APHA).</p>
<p class="govuk-body">We want as many people as possible to be able to use this service. For example, you should be able to:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>zoom in up to 400% without the text spilling off the screen</li>
    <li>navigate most of the service using just a keyboard</li>
    <li>use the service with a screen reader</li>
    <li>use the service in light or dark mode, following your device settings</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Compliance status</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">This service is partially compliant with the <a class="govuk-link" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/" rel="noreferrer noopener">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines version 2.2</a> AA standard. Known issues are listed below.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Known accessibility issues</h2>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
    <li>Some pages may not fully reflow at high zoom levels or narrow viewport widths.</li>
    <li>Some data tables may contain empty cells.</li>
    <li>Some help content is being reviewed for accuracy.</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">We are working to fix these issues.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Feedback and contact information</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">If you find any problems not listed on this page, or think we are not meeting accessibility requirements, contact your service administrator or the APHA service desk.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Enforcement procedure</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">If you are not happy with how we respond to your complaint, contact the <a class="govuk-link" href="https://www.equalityadvisoryservice.com/" rel="noreferrer noopener">Equality Advisory and Support Service (EASS)</a>.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Preparation of this accessibility statement</h2>
<p class="govuk-body">This statement was prepared in 2026. It was last reviewed following accessibility testing of the service.</p>

